    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.73,
      397.17,
      225.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      236.09,
      397.19,
      305.99
    ],
    "text": "(a)performance of welfare activites, and providing loanfacilities which would result in the socialeconomical Development of Employees and theretired officers of the Central Government and theLocal Government Sector and the LocalGovernment Sector;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      316.37,
      397.18,
      351.11
    ],
    "text": "(b)starting and maintaining industries and serviceswhich would result in generating employmentopportunities; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      361.49,
      397.18,
      384.47
    ],
    "text": "(c)to work co-operatively with similar establishmentin Sri Lanka and Overseas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      396.53,
      397.17,
      419.63
    ],
    "text": "4. Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      429.89,
      397.19,
      464.63
    ],
    "text": "(a)receiving money required for the functioning ofthe Corporation of the basis of loans or grants fromlawful Banks and Financial Establishments;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      475.01,
      397.16,
      498.11
    ],
    "text": "(b)to enter into agreements or contracts with any personor body of persons in Sri Lanka or Overseas;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      508.49,
      397.19,
      625.07
    ],
    "text": "(c)subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the powerto do, perform and executive all such acts, mattersand things as are necessary or desirable for thepromotion or furtherance of the objects of theCorporation and close bank accounts, to receive orcollect grants and donations, to invest funds and toengage, employ and dismiss, officers and servantsrequired for carrying out of the objects of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      635.45,
      397.17,
      670.19
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall subject to the provisions of this Actand the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
