      251.39
    ],
    "text": "vest in a Governing Council (hereafter referred to as \u201ctheDirector Board\u201d) consisting of such number of membersincluding the Chairman in accordance with the rules in forcefor the time being if the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.88,
      300.59
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Board of Directors holding posts on the day priorto the implementation of this Act should be treated as thefirst Board of Directors of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      313.85,
      401.9,
      362.03
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Board of Directors fromtime to time to make rules not inconsistence with theprovisions of this Act or any other written law for thefollowing matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      375.29,
      401.9,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "(a)election and qualifications of the Board of Directorsincluding the Chairman, expulsion, payment ofallowances and travelling, qualifications andappointment of staff, disciplinary matters, and allrules with regards to payment of salaries wages andallowances;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      461.45,
      401.9,
      497.39
    ],
    "text": "(b)all rules with regards to, performence, maintenanceand protection of the common objectives appearingin the Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      510.65,
      401.89,
      546.59
    ],
    "text": "(c)all rules with regards to, implementation,maintenance and protection of powers appearingin the Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      559.85,
      401.89,
      608.03
    ],
    "text": "(d)all rules with regards to, Director Board meetings,minutes general adminstration, accounts auditingfinance statements, rules and all rules needed tomaintain records.",
